'''Mighty Gui Zuli''' (バトルクマッチョ, ''Batoru Kumaccho'', '''Battle Bear Macho''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 2.5 Update|Version 2.5]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Mighty Gui Zuli
|image = E 108.png
|first appearance = [[300 Years Probation]]
|latest appearance = [[Infernal Tower/Floor 15|Infernal Tower - Floor 15]]
|money drop = 2,000¢ - 7,900¢
}}

==Enemy==
This variant of [[Teacher Bear]] is much stronger and has a lot more stamina, with about a third of Teacher Bears knockbacks. However, he moves slower than Teacher Bear, whose speed is already pitifully slow.

==Strategy==
Spam meatshields, such as [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]] and [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]], to stall while you save up money. Send out cats with with good range and attack power who also have [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|Area Attack]] (e.g. [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon Cat]], [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Vaulter Cat]] and/or [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Figure Skating Cats]]) to kill off all the peons. Finally, summon in strong, tanky cats, such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] or [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]] to deal the finishing blow.

