==Trivia==
*Mighty Gui Zuli's English name may be play on the word ''grizzly''.
*Mighty Gui Zuli's Japanese name, ''Battle Kumaccho'', is a play on words, with ''kuma'' meaning bear, and ''macho'' meaning strength.

